    "https://www.southeastern.edu/college-of-arts-humanities-and-social-sciences/": {
      "title": "Admissions and Aid",
      "description": "College of Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences - Southeastern Louisiana University Skip to main content Apply Give Visit Admissions and Aid Learn about Admissions and Aid Financial Aid Scholarships Tuition and Fees Academics Learn about Academics Majors and Minors University Catalog Library Academic Calendar Graduate Studies Southeastern Online College of Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences College of Business College of Education, Health and Human Sciences College of Nursing College of Science and Technology College of Honors and Excellence Campus Life Learn about Campus Life Dining Services Housing Safe Campus Rec Center Health Center Campus Map (opens in a new tab) Parking Division of Student Affairs About Learn about Southeastern History Administration Accreditation Offices and Services Employee Directory News Read all of our news sources News Southeastern Magazine Profiles Blog Lion Up Radio (opens in a new tab) Southeastern Channel (opens in a new tab) Lion’s Roar (opens in a new tab) Athletics (opens in a new tab) Quick Links Canvas (opens in a new tab) Workday (opens in a new tab) Okta Login Portal (opens in a new tab) Gmail (opens in a new tab) Calendar (opens in a new tab) Learn about Workday Links For Alumni Home College of Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences Explore this section Explore this section Scholarships Related Programs Student Organizations Staff FAQs Fanfare Enhance your intellectual and cultural world through the wide variety of programs in the College of Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences. With support from expert and caring faculty, you’ll learn to become a flexible and disciplined thinker who can approach life situations from multiple perspectives and solve problems in diverse situations that span your work, personal, and civic life. The mission of the College of Arts, Humanities, and Social Sciences is to advance the intellectual and cultural development of our students and the communities of southeastern Louisiana. College Highlights Major provider of courses in the university's general education curriculum Students work closely with faculty on research projects and scholarly and creative activities Students are nationally competitive when applying for graduate programs, prestigious awards and recognitions, and career opportunities Play embedded video: Learn about the College Watch accessible video for Learn about the College (opens in a new tab) Read video transcript for Learn about the College (opens in a new tab) Departments Department of Communication and Media Studies Department of English and World Languages Department of History and Political Science Department of Music and Performing Arts Department of Psychology Department of Sociology and Criminal Justice Department of Visual Art + Design General Studies Program Find Your Path Choose from 17 degree programs in arts, humanities, and social sciences. View Majors and Minors In the News Blog Bridget Hester – President’s Award for Excellence in Teaching One of only three political scientists in the Department of History and Political Science, Hester teaches a wide range of courses and helps prepare students to become informed citizens and future leaders. By: Tonya Lowentritt August 14, 2026 News Southeastern’s Columbia Theatre to screen ‘Top Gun’ By: Tonya Lowentritt August 21, 2026 News Southeastern’s Columbia Theatre to present tribute to David Bowie By: Tonya Lowentritt July 21, 2026 News Southeastern, Gateway Ford award sports media scholarship By: Tonya Lowentritt June 25, 2026 View all News Upcoming Events View all Events (opens in a new tab) Profiles Alumni Profile Get There: Leading Young Musicians on the Field Tuba and euphonium player Demille Davis is setting a high bar to reach his dream job as a high school marching band director: expanding his repertoire to include all concert instruments. August 10, 2026 View all Profiles Contact Us Location Campus Address Fayard Hall, Room 300 SLU Box 10767 Hammond, LA