    "https://www.southeastern.edu/college-of-nursing/": {
      "title": "Admissions and Aid",
      "description": "College of Nursing - Southeastern Louisiana University Skip to main content Apply Give Visit Admissions and Aid Learn about Admissions and Aid Financial Aid Scholarships Tuition and Fees Academics Learn about Academics Majors and Minors University Catalog Library Academic Calendar Graduate Studies Southeastern Online College of Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences College of Business College of Education, Health and Human Sciences College of Nursing College of Science and Technology College of Honors and Excellence Campus Life Learn about Campus Life Dining Services Housing Safe Campus Rec Center Health Center Campus Map (opens in a new tab) Parking Division of Student Affairs About Learn about Southeastern History Administration Accreditation Offices and Services Employee Directory News Read all of our news sources News Southeastern Magazine Profiles Blog Lion Up Radio (opens in a new tab) Southeastern Channel (opens in a new tab) Lion’s Roar (opens in a new tab) Athletics (opens in a new tab) Quick Links Canvas (opens in a new tab) Workday (opens in a new tab) Okta Login Portal (opens in a new tab) Gmail (opens in a new tab) Calendar (opens in a new tab) Learn about Workday Links For Alumni Home College of Nursing Explore this section Explore this section Scholarships Living Learning Community Student Research Student Organizations FAQs Staff Prepare to meet current and future wellness and health care demands through a variety of innovative curricula in Southeastern’s College of Nursing. You’ll have the opportunity to interact closely with faculty in programs that are both challenging and exciting while developing the competencies that will help you succeed in your chosen career path. The mission of the College of Nursing is to promote individual, family and community health across the lifespan through interprofessional teaching, scholarship and service. College Highlights More than 3,700 students actively involved in innovative curricula that include classroom, clinical, internship and practicum experiences Partnerships with more than 100 agencies provide our students with diverse practice opportunities Graduates are highly competitive for employment and graduate study opportunities Play embedded video: Learn about the College Watch accessible video for Learn about the College (opens in a new tab) Read video transcript for Learn about the College (opens in a new tab) Departments School of Nursing Find Your Path Be immersed in wellness and prevention, human development and services, and managing complex health care needs to become a leading health care professional. Choose the program that’s right for you and where you want to go next. View Majors and Minors In the News Blog How to Move In the Lion Way! Discover essential tips, event schedules, and packing advice to make your transition into Southeastern’s Lion family seamless and unforgettable. By: Brock Sanders August 12, 2026 News Southeastern Nursing and Health Sciences students honored By: Tonya Lowentritt May 27, 2026 News Southeastern hosts regional conference on artificial intelligence in healthcare By: Tonya Lowentritt April 17, 2026 News Southeastern to present Research and Innovation Showcase By: Tonya Lowentritt March 17, 2026 View all News Upcoming Events View all Events (opens in a new tab) Profiles Student Profile Get There: Into Making a Comeback After putting her career on hold for several years to raise a family, Lori Robertson is on the brink reentering the healthcare field and helping patients fulltime—at an even more advanced level. August 3, 2026 View all Profiles Contact Us Location Campus Address Kinesiology and Health Studies Annex, Room 2026 SLU Box 10781 Hammond, LA 70402 Phone (985) 549-3772 Email cnhs​@southeastern.edu Dean Professor / Dean Ann Carruth Request Info Apply Visit Southeastern Louisiana University's Facebook account (opens in a new tab) Southeastern Louisiana University's Instagram account (opens in a new tab) S