    "https://www.southeastern.edu/college-of-science-and-technology/": {
      "title": "Admissions and Aid",
      "description": "College of Science and Technology - Southeastern Louisiana University Skip to main content Apply Give Visit Admissions and Aid Learn about Admissions and Aid Financial Aid Scholarships Tuition and Fees Academics Learn about Academics Majors and Minors University Catalog Library Academic Calendar Graduate Studies Southeastern Online College of Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences College of Business College of Education, Health and Human Sciences College of Nursing College of Science and Technology College of Honors and Excellence Campus Life Learn about Campus Life Dining Services Housing Safe Campus Rec Center Health Center Campus Map (opens in a new tab) Parking Division of Student Affairs About Learn about Southeastern History Administration Accreditation Offices and Services Employee Directory News Read all of our news sources News Southeastern Magazine Profiles Blog Lion Up Radio (opens in a new tab) Southeastern Channel (opens in a new tab) Lion’s Roar (opens in a new tab) Athletics (opens in a new tab) Quick Links Canvas (opens in a new tab) Workday (opens in a new tab) Okta Login Portal (opens in a new tab) Gmail (opens in a new tab) Calendar (opens in a new tab) Learn about Workday Links For Alumni Home College of Science and Technology Explore this section Explore this section Scholarships Center for Environmental Research Outreach Programs Southeastern Northshore STEM Center Student Research Related Programs Staff FAQs Engagement Prepare for success in the workplace or further studies with one of 15 high-quality degree programs in Southeastern’s College of Science and Technology. You’ll receive personalized learning experiences and support from our faculty who are experts in their fields. From supervised research to group projects that study real-world problems, you’ll gain the experience, knowledge, and skills needed to become nationally competitive for the best jobs, graduate schools, and professional programs. The mission of the College of Science and Technology is to advance knowledge, foster innovation, and prepare students for meaningful careers and lifelong learning through rigorous, student-centered education in the sciences and technological disciplines. With a deep connection to the industries within our region, we cultivate critical thinking, collaborative problem-solving, and technical excellence while embracing the region’s unique environmental, industrial, and economic landscape. Through transformative teaching, applied research, and community engagement, we empower graduates to lead, innovate, and serve as responsible stewards of science and technology in a rapidly evolving world. College Highlights Internationally recognized faculty Active undergraduate research program Numerous opportunities for paid internships Play embedded video: Learn about the College Watch accessible video for Learn about the College (opens in a new tab) Read video transcript for Learn about the College (opens in a new tab) Departments Department of Biological Sciences Department of Chemistry and Physics Department of Computer Science Department of Industrial and Engineering Technology Department of Mathematics Find Your Path With five departments offering numerous degrees and concentrations, we have a program that’s just right for you. Choose from one of our challenging degree programs in biological sciences, chemistry, physics, computer science, industrial technology, mathematics, and other related fields. View Majors and Minors In the News Southeastern Magazine Southeastern Giving Day 2025 Sets Historic Record of Support Southeastern’s Centennial Giving Day 2025 broke school records by raising over $508,000 from nearly 2,400 donors to support student scholarships, campus programs, and future university growth. By: Mike Rivault August 3, 2026 News Southeastern Computer Science Department to present Industry Connect Lecture By: Tonya Lowentritt September 3, 2026 News Southeastern to host Artificial Intelligence Launchpad By: Tonya Lowentritt July 9, 2026 News Southeastern announces two new academic concentrations By: Tonya Lowentritt June 23, 2026 View all News Upcoming Events View all Events (opens in a new tab) Profiles Student Profile Get There: Into Bringing Liftoff to Life Connor Miller, a recent engineering technology graduate with a passion for math and science, has already landed his dream job straight out of college--becoming a software engineer for Boeing. May 10, 2026 View all Profiles Contact Us Location Campus Address Meade Hall, Room 113 SLU Box 10829 Hammond, LA 70402 Phone (985) 549-2055 Email science​@southeastern.edu Dean Professor/Dean Mitchell Croatt, Ph.D. Connect College of Science and Technology's Facebook account (opens in a new tab) College of Science and Technology's Instagram account (opens in a new tab) College of Science and Technology's LinkedIn account (opens in a new tab) Request Info Apply Visit Southeastern Louisiana University's Facebook account (opens in a new tab) Southeastern Louisiana University's Instagram account (opens in a new tab) Southeastern Louisiana University's X account (opens in a new tab) Southeastern Louisiana University's YouTube account (opens in a new tab) Southeastern Louisiana University's LinkedIn account (opens in a new tab) Southeastern Louisiana University's TikTok account (opens in a new tab) University Hours Monday - Thursday 7:30 a.m. - 5:00 p.m. Friday 7:30 a.m. - 12:30 p.m. Contact Us (985) 549-2000 500 West University Ave. Hammond, LA 70402 Resources Employment Campus Crime Stats Privacy Web Accessibility Technology and Security Economic Impact Report Title IX University of Louisiana System (opens in a new tab) SACSCOC Accreditation Website Login Copyright © 2026 Southeastern Louisiana University All Rights Reserved This website uses cookies to ensure site visitors enjoy the best experience. By continuing to use this site, you accept our use of cookies and Privacy Statement. To learn more, please visit Southeastern Privacy Statement . I Accept Close GDPR Cookie Settings Privacy Overview Strictly Necessary Cookies Powered by GDPR Cookie Compliance Privacy Overview This website uses cookies so that we can provide you with the best user experience possible. Cookie information is stored in your browser and performs functions such as recognising you when you return to our website and helping our team to understand which sections of the website you find most interesting and useful. Strictly Necessary Cookies Strictly Necessary Cookie should be enabled at all times so that we can save your preferences for cookie settings. Enable or Disable Cookies Enabled Disabled Enable All Save Settings"
