    "https://www.southeastern.edu/college-of-honors-and-excellence/": {
      "title": "Admissions and Aid",
      "description": "College of Honors and Excellence - Southeastern Louisiana University Skip to main content Apply Give Visit Admissions and Aid Learn about Admissions and Aid Financial Aid Scholarships Tuition and Fees Academics Learn about Academics Majors and Minors University Catalog Library Academic Calendar Graduate Studies Southeastern Online College of Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences College of Business College of Education, Health and Human Sciences College of Nursing College of Science and Technology College of Honors and Excellence Campus Life Learn about Campus Life Dining Services Housing Safe Campus Rec Center Health Center Campus Map (opens in a new tab) Parking Division of Student Affairs About Learn about Southeastern History Administration Accreditation Offices and Services Employee Directory News Read all of our news sources News Southeastern Magazine Profiles Blog Lion Up Radio (opens in a new tab) Southeastern Channel (opens in a new tab) Lion’s Roar (opens in a new tab) Athletics (opens in a new tab) Quick Links Canvas (opens in a new tab) Workday (opens in a new tab) Okta Login Portal (opens in a new tab) Gmail (opens in a new tab) Calendar (opens in a new tab) Learn about Workday Links For Alumni Home College of Honors and Excellence Explore this section Explore this section Honors Program First-Year Success Academic & Career Exploration Transfer Student Success Center Tinsley Learning Center Student Resources For Parents Staff CHE Ambassadors Excellence for Every Student at Every Level. The College of Honors and Excellence is focused on educating the whole student, bridging the gap between curricular and extracurricular learning, and ensuring effective student transition and success. We are the launch pad for most incoming freshmen enrolling at Southeastern including students in our selective Honors Program. We have units dedicated to serving returning and transfer students and supporting student learning. Our mission is to work as a cohesive unit in partnership with the university community to assist students in becoming active, responsible, and successful learners. We are committed to creating an environment that fosters student development and retention by integrating the strengths of an honors college with the supportive framework of a university college. To fulfill this mission, the College of Honors and Excellence provides specific programming and resources that encourage students to develop the skills and strategies that enhance academic achievement and personal and professional growth. College Highlights Honors students culminate their college career with a significant research experience or artistic endeavor during their senior year. Academic and Career Exploration (ACE) Coaches are here to provide support and guidance for Southeastern students. The Tinsley Learning Center is a Level III CRLA certified Lab. Our certified tutors have met the rigor as set forth by the CRLA. Departments Academic and Career Exploration First-Year Success Tinsley Learning Center Honors Program Transfer Student Success Center Find Your Path Through highly competitive degree programs, Southeastern prepares students for their best futures. Wherever you want to go, Southeastern can help you Get There. View Majors and Minors In the News Blog How to Move In the Lion Way! Discover essential tips, event schedules, and packing advice to make your transition into Southeastern’s Lion family seamless and unforgettable. By: Brock Sanders August 12, 2026 News Southeastern College of Honors and Excellence recognizes top students By: Tonya Lowentritt May 7, 2026 News Southeastern President Featured in CEO Magazine By: Tonya Lowentritt January 7, 2026 News Southeastern accreditation reaffirmed, Wainwright elected to board of trustees By: Tonya Lowentritt December 18, 2025 View all News Upcoming Events View all Events (opens in a new tab) Contact Us Location Campus Address Student Union West, Room 1303 Hammond, LA 70402 Phon